 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Lots of people feel that way. The best way to start is to draw every day for five minutes. Pick a simple subject like a cup of coffee, and just draw the shapes. Don't worry about it looking good, the point is to practice seeing. It' what you see when there's no time to think. If you draw a cup slowly, you stop at the details, but in few minutes you see the shape clearly. That's fine. Start by drawing the stick figure from different angles, then add simple lines for the background. Before you know it, you' built a little world.",
